Hi xxxx,&nbsp;<br />
<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting Qantas Customer Care.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
I was very sorry to hear about the expense you incurred while delayed overnight due to the disruption caused as a result of engineering issues on QF80 Narita to Melbourne on 5 April 2024.<br />
<br />
The safety of our passengers and crew is always Qantas' top priority, however, we appreciate the disappointment and frustration this caused.<br />
<br />
I want to apologise on behalf of Qantas for the way this situation was handled and the communication on this occasion.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Your experience matters to us, and you should always expect to receive a helpful service and great communication.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
We would like to offer you $xxxx as reimbursement for your expenses incurred.<br />
<br />
<br />
Or<br />
<br />
<br />
We would like to offer you $xxxx as compensation due to accommodation unavailability.<br />
<br />
<br />
<em>****For Consultants**** to refer to this as a guide for reimbursement If the passenger WAS NOT ABLE TO source accommodation and slept in the terminal:<br />
<br />
ECONOMY: $500 travel voucher<br />
<br />
BUSINESSS: $800 travel voucher ********</em><br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
Please fill out the&nbsp;<a aria-label="Link Customer Care Payment form" href="https://qantas.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/900000010OOK/a/Mo000000wbFJ/Nt5xWemvas4.AlIOUN_Q1SMX0Gv6VcPj9gS3jis9bh0" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" title="https://qantas.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/900000010ook/a/mo000000wbfj/nt5xwemvas4.alioun_q1smx0gv6vcpj9gs3jis9bh0">Customer Care Payment form</a>&nbsp;with your bank account details so that we can process any reimbursement.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
When returning the completed form, please reply to this email. This will ensure the documentation is attached to your file and actioned as soon as possible.&nbsp;</p>
